ass=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">Власт</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Властта: кой решава и как</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Кой взема решенията, как се приемат законите и къде има особености, които заслужават внимание. Всяко число води към подробностите и първоизточника.</div></div></div><nav aria-label=\"Секции на страницата\" class=\"sticky top-14 lg:top-0 z-30 -mx-4 sm:-mx-6 px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 mb-8 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-rule\"><ul class=\"flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto text-[15px] whitespace-nowrap\"><li><a href=\"#koy\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Кой управлява</a></li><li><a href=\"#signali\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Сигнали</a></li><li><a href=\"#kak\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Как се приема закон</a></li><li><a href=\"#zakoni\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Законите</a></li><li><a href=\"#firmi\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Депутати и фирми</a></li><li><a href=\"#proverka\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Как да проверите</a></li></ul></nav><section class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-14\"><a class=\"block bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 no-underline text-ink hover:ring-2 hover:ring-green\" href=\"#signali\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Закони със сериозен сигнал</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.9rem] sm:text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">11</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">от 62 гласувани закона</p></a><a class=\"block bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 no-underline text-ink hover:ring-2 hover:ring-green\" href=\"/parlament/signali\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Нови текстове в заключителните разпоредби</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.9rem] sm:text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">6</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">закона, променени така на второ четене</p></a><a class=\"block bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 no-underline text-ink hover:ring-2 hover:ring-green\" href=\"#signali\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Закони със съкратен срок за предложения</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.9rem] sm:text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">18</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">по-малко от обичайните 7 дни между четенията</p></a><a class=\"block bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 no-underline text-ink hover:ring-2 hover:ring-green\" href=\"#firmi\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Депутати с дял или управление във фирми</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.9rem] sm:text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">19</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">по Търговския регистър и декларациите</p></a><a class=\"block bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 no-underline text-ink hover:ring-2 hover:ring-green\" href=\"/obeshtaniya\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Неизпълнени обещания</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.9rem] sm:text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">26</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">при 41 изпълнени, 12 правителства</p></a><a class=\"block bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 no-underline text-ink hover:ring-2 hover:ring-green\" href=\"/proverki\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Подвеждащи или неверни твърдения</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.9rem] sm:text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">5</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">проверени с източници</p></a><a class=\"block bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 no-underline text-ink hover:ring-2 hover:ring-green\" href=\"/proverki/sankcii\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Санкционирани по „Магнитски“ и др.</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.9rem] sm:text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">11</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">български политици и длъжностни лица</p></a></section><section id=\"koy\" class=\"mb-16 scroll-mt-32 lg:scroll-mt-20\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mb-2\">Кой управлява сега</h2><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted mb-5 max-w-3xl\">Управляваща партия с мнозинство в 52-рото Народно събрание. Правителство „Радев“ от 8 май 2026 г. (от 8 май 2026 г.).</p><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,7fr)] items-start